This patch modifies moai-adk v3.1.2 (Apache-2.0, https://github.com/modu-ai/moai-adk).
The release build of the moai plugin applies it to the pinned source release before it builds plugin/bin/moai.

Change: the hooks and the status line read the configuration home of Claude Code from CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR when it holds an
absolute path, and from the home folder joined with .claude otherwise (paths.ClaudeDir). Without it, a session that runs
with its own configuration home removes the task folders of ~/.claude/tasks at its end, removes the team folders of
~/.claude/teams that are older than 24 hours, and writes memory into ~/.claude/projects, which belong to other sessions.

